BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Film Night: 8½ (1963)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260613T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260613T214500
UID:4616e9296207568bbe013b4e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:8½ follows a film director who\, overwhelmed by creative bloc
 k and the pressures of life\, retreats into memories\, dreams\, and fantas
 ies. Blurring reality and imagination\, the film becomes a playful and pro
 found reflection on creativity\, identity\, and the struggle to make sense
  of one’s life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/film-night-8-1963-13-jun
 -2026
